# GGUF Loader Specification v1.0

## Supported Quantization Types

### Tier A (Recommended)
- Q4_K_M: Default, balanced
- Q5_K_M: Higher quality, better reasoning
- Q6_K: Near FP16, excellent for coding

### Tier B (Compact)
- Q3_K_M: Low memory target
- Q4_K_S, Q5_K_S: Small variants

### Tier C (IQ Quant)
- IQ2_K, IQ3_M, IQ4_XS: Ultra-low memory

## EFC Definition
EFC.Hacedle.Loader.GGUF:
- inspect: Read header, metadata, tensor layout
- mmap: Memory-map tensor arena
- quant_route: Route based on quantization type
- tensor_projection: Create TensorDescriptor
- provider_dispatch: Dispatch to appropriate provider

## Universal Loader ABI
pub trait ModelLoader {
    fn inspect() -> ModelMetadata;
    fn mount() -> Result<ModelProjection>;
    fn route() -> Result<ExecutionPlan>;
}